  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Con gran entusiasmo se desarrolló esta tradicional celebración en la Ribera Norte del río Maullín, jornada que reunió a familias y vecinos en torno a la música, el folclore, la gastronomía y las tradiciones chilenas.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🎶\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t1f/1/16/1f3b6.png\"/> Fue una instancia para compartir, disfrutar y celebrar nuestras raíces en comunidad, en el marco de las actividades de Fiestas Patrias.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👏\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tfe/1/16/1f44f.png\"/> Una jornada marcada por la participación, la identidad y el encuentro de la comunidad.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/maull%C3%ADn?__cft__[0]=AZjJp2N9PUrWOAlD9LAslJTWJx1QfEc4sUyNj1dAXAPRvEc8DXblgVUhH7K0qFoFiQR2pcP7dK1xld3Bj9SvZGWd4k391N57v0hVMYDwHnoHW2NcIqdhuVa7w90PJrQBn70YiPS85EfrkHvhaT_pvyIkKDxdpnNwBWahrwKNm2XV11cwKG82Yh5GLik&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Maullín</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/riberanorte?__cft__[0]=AZjJp2N9PUrWOAlD9LAslJTWJx1QfEc4sUyNj1dAXAPRvEc8DXblgVUhH7K0qFoFiQR2pcP7dK1xld3Bj9SvZGWd4k391N57v0hVMYDwHnoHW2NcIqdhuVa7w90PJrQBn70YiPS85EfrkHvhaT_pvyIkKDxdpnNwBWahrwKNm2XV11cwKG82Yh5GLik&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#RiberaNorte</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/fiestadelachilenidad?__cft__[0]=AZjJp2N9PUrWOAlD9LAslJTWJx1QfEc4sUyNj1dAXAPRvEc8DXblgVUhH7K0qFoFiQR2pcP7dK1xld3Bj9SvZGWd4k391N57v0hVMYDwHnoHW2NcIqdhuVa7w90PJrQBn70YiPS85EfrkHvhaT_pvyIkKDxdpnNwBWahrwKNm2XV11cwKG82Yh5GLik&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#FiestaDeLaChilenidad</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/fiestaspatrias?__cft__[0]=AZjJp2N9PUrWOAlD9LAslJTWJx1QfEc4sUyNj1dAXAPRvEc8DXblgVUhH7K0qFoFiQR2pcP7dK1xld3Bj9SvZGWd4k391N57v0hVMYDwHnoHW2NcIqdhuVa7w90PJrQBn70YiPS85EfrkHvhaT_pvyIkKDxdpnNwBWahrwKNm2XV11cwKG82Yh5GLik&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#FiestasPatrias</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/tradiciones?__cft__[0]=AZjJp2N9PUrWOAlD9LAslJTWJx1QfEc4sUyNj1dAXAPRvEc8DXblgVUhH7K0qFoFiQR2pcP7dK1xld3Bj9SvZGWd4k391N57v0hVMYDwHnoHW2NcIqdhuVa7w90PJrQBn70YiPS85EfrkHvhaT_pvyIkKDxdpnNwBWahrwKNm2XV11cwKG82Yh5GLik&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Tradiciones</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/folclore?__cft__[0]=AZjJp2N9PUrWOAlD9LAslJTWJx1QfEc4sUyNj1dAXAPRvEc8DXblgVUhH7K0qFoFiQR2pcP7dK1xld3Bj9SvZGWd4k391N57v0hVMYDwHnoHW2NcIqdhuVa7w90PJrQBn70YiPS85EfrkHvhaT_pvyIkKDxdpnNwBWahrwKNm2XV11cwKG82Yh5GLik&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Folclore</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14425\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/9q1mx7rf46aktc6/dsc_5996_efen31crno.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14423\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/tl3pwwqa6bjxq3t/dsc_6007_vq90j5jaw1.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14430\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this